<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore to spend further S$1.0 bln on industry.</title>
<headline>Singapore to spend further S$1.0 bln on industry.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore will spend an additional Singapore $1.0 billion on industrial development, state-owned Chartered Semiconductor said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>It said the money would be distributed through the government's Cluster Development Fund for venture capital.</p>
<p>The statement said the fund had previously managed S$1.3 billion, of which S$500 million had been committed to strategic projects.</p>
</text>
